# Each runtime loads its own environment file, not this root template.
# Web: copy apps/web/.env.example to apps/web/.env.local.
# API: copy apps/api/.env.example to apps/api/.env.
# Worker: copy apps/worker/.env.example to apps/worker/.env.
# Database tooling: copy packages/database/.env.example to packages/database/.env.
# Contracts: copy contracts/.env.example to contracts/.env.
# Supply real values only in the corresponding local file or deployment secret store.
# Private signing keys belong exclusively to the executor runtime or owner wallet.
